1
00:01:26,440 --> 00:01:30,920
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:01:34,920 --> 00:01:37,080
The mountains here are lush and beautiful.

3
00:01:37,160 --> 00:01:38,240
Mist curls around the peaks.

4
00:01:38,320 --> 00:01:41,000
From the valley floor,
it looks like a fairyland.

5
00:01:41,520 --> 00:01:44,480
The scenery in this painting

6
00:01:45,240 --> 00:01:47,480
really does resemble this valley.

7
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:49,040
Then, Miss A-Luo...

8
00:01:49,520 --> 00:01:51,240
-Do you know of a kind of...
-Miss A-Luo.

9
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:53,360
I noticed there are

10
00:01:53,440 --> 00:01:55,840
many flowers in the courtyard.
What are they for?

11
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:58,200
Tomorrow is our valley's Flower Festival.

12
00:01:58,280 --> 00:02:00,480
I'm preparing flower cakes
for the festival.

13
00:02:01,040 --> 00:02:02,040
Please make yourselves comfortable.

14
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:03,240
Have a good chat.

15
00:02:03,320 --> 00:02:04,320
If you need anything,

16
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:05,840
just call for me.

17
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:13,800
Lord Meng.

18
00:02:14,440 --> 00:02:17,160
I was about to ask about
where the Fuqing Grass grows. Why...?

19
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:18,680
We only just arrived.

20
00:02:19,480 --> 00:02:21,120
If we bring up Fuqing Grass so soon,

21
00:02:21,200 --> 00:02:22,680
we may alert whoever is behind this.

22
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:24,120
Lord Meng.

23
00:02:24,920 --> 00:02:27,040
Miss A-Luo is kind and guileless.

24
00:02:27,600 --> 00:02:29,880
She treated me when I was poisoned
by that snake.

25
00:02:29,960 --> 00:02:31,160
She and her brother depend
on each other.

26
00:02:31,240 --> 00:02:34,000
The villagers live almost entirely
cut off from the outside world.

27
00:02:34,080 --> 00:02:35,480
They rarely deal with outsiders.

28
00:02:36,040 --> 00:02:36,880
To be safe,

29
00:02:37,320 --> 00:02:39,040
we should investigate on our own first.

30
00:02:39,680 --> 00:02:40,840
Yin Qing.

31
00:02:40,920 --> 00:02:43,240
You know mountain terrain better than us.

32
00:02:43,320 --> 00:02:44,600
For this operation,

33
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:46,560
-you arrange everyone's route.
-Yes.

34
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:48,240
Your Majesty.

35
00:02:48,320 --> 00:02:50,000
Wangxian Valley has difficult terrain.

36
00:02:50,080 --> 00:02:52,160
Snakes, insects, and vermin
are common here.

37
00:02:52,240 --> 00:02:53,360
For safety's sake,

38
00:02:53,440 --> 00:02:54,280
I suggest

39
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:56,120
we search in male-female pairs.

40
00:02:56,680 --> 00:02:58,000
I'll go with Zhili.

41
00:02:58,080 --> 00:02:59,120
Look how eager you are.

42
00:02:59,200 --> 00:03:01,280
Is Zhili your sister or mine?

43
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:02,480
Then I...

44
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:04,640
will reluctantly pair up with Miss Yan.

45
00:03:04,720 --> 00:03:06,120
You beat me to saying it.

46
00:03:06,200 --> 00:03:08,240
Who exactly is the reluctant one?
Explain yourself.

47
00:03:09,440 --> 00:03:10,680
A slip of the tongue.

48
00:03:10,760 --> 00:03:11,720
What I meant was,

49
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:13,280
having the chance to protect Miss Yan

50
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:14,240
is my honor.

51
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:15,840
That's more like it.

52
00:03:17,200 --> 00:03:18,560
Then I'll go with my lord...

53
00:03:18,640 --> 00:03:20,360
Your martial arts are too poor.
You can't protect Lord Meng.

54
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:22,560
I'll go with her tomorrow.

55
00:03:22,640 --> 00:03:24,000
Whatever you find,

56
00:03:24,080 --> 00:03:25,520
everyone must return before dark.

57
00:03:26,440 --> 00:03:27,280
What about me?

58
00:03:27,360 --> 00:03:28,360
Old Huang.

59
00:03:28,440 --> 00:03:30,160
You have an important role here.

60
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:33,400
Old Huang.

61
00:03:33,480 --> 00:03:35,240
Spend more time talking with Miss A-Luo.

62
00:03:35,320 --> 00:03:37,720
-Get to know each other better.
-Don't talk nonsense.

63
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:38,960
Old Huang.

64
00:03:39,040 --> 00:03:40,000
I mean,

65
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:41,160
you and Miss A-Luo should

66
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:42,920
build a little friendship.

67
00:03:43,480 --> 00:03:45,920
Learn more about the customs
of Wangxian Valley.

68
00:03:46,480 --> 00:03:47,320
What were you thinking?

69
00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:52,520
Old Huang.

70
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:55,920
-Don't tell me you want to...
-I don't!

71
00:03:59,080 --> 00:04:00,280
Daning's lands are magnificent.

72
00:04:01,240 --> 00:04:02,920
There is the fairyland
of Wangxian Valley,

73
00:04:03,600 --> 00:04:04,880
and the vastness of Shazhou.

74
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:06,160
Across this splendid realm,

75
00:04:08,040 --> 00:04:08,920
there are still

76
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:10,400
so many sights I have never seen.

77
00:04:14,600 --> 00:04:15,480
In the blink of an eye,

78
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:17,240
I've been away from Shazhou
for a long time too.

79
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:19,640
Were you born in Shazhou?

80
00:04:20,480 --> 00:04:22,400
Or were you taken there
by traffickers?

81
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:23,920
I don't remember.

82
00:04:24,400 --> 00:04:25,800
For as long as I can remember,

83
00:04:26,440 --> 00:04:27,840
I've lived in Shazhou.

84
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:30,080
What about your parents?

85
00:04:30,760 --> 00:04:31,920
Do you remember them at all?

86
00:04:33,080 --> 00:04:34,160
Everything from before...

87
00:04:34,240 --> 00:04:35,440
I can't remember any of it.

88
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:37,040
Why do I feel

89
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:40,480
Your Majesty keeps asking
about my past lately?

90
00:04:41,480 --> 00:04:42,800
As though you're investigating me.

91
00:04:45,560 --> 00:04:47,440
Am I not allowed to be curious about you?

92
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:54,400
As for my past,

93
00:04:55,080 --> 00:04:56,680
doesn't Your Majesty already know it well?

94
00:04:56,760 --> 00:04:58,200
Precisely because I've seen darkness,

95
00:04:59,560 --> 00:05:01,720
I am determined to uproot it completely.

96
00:05:39,040 --> 00:05:40,200
Rest here for a while.

97
00:05:40,280 --> 00:05:41,400
I'll find us something to eat.

98
00:06:03,400 --> 00:06:04,440
Here.

99
00:06:04,520 --> 00:06:06,400
Mountain fruit is best freshly picked.

100
00:06:07,080 --> 00:06:08,160
Have some to tide you over.

101
00:06:13,840 --> 00:06:14,920
How is it?

102
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:17,120
So sweet.

103
00:06:22,840 --> 00:06:23,920
Want one?

104
00:06:24,440 --> 00:06:25,560
You eat it.

105
00:06:26,800 --> 00:06:28,960
-It's so cold.
-I'll add more firewood.

106
00:06:50,640 --> 00:06:51,640
What's wrong?

107
00:06:52,360 --> 00:06:53,400
I'm so hot.

108
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:55,840
It's freezing out here.

109
00:06:55,920 --> 00:06:56,960
Don't catch a chill.

110
00:07:22,880 --> 00:07:25,000
I've never seen Your Majesty
this close before.

111
00:07:25,080 --> 00:07:26,640
You seem

112
00:07:27,720 --> 00:07:29,360
different from usual today.

113
00:07:35,760 --> 00:07:36,840
What's wrong?

114
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:43,320
What's happening?

115
00:07:58,320 --> 00:07:59,240
Try one.

116
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:19,560
Don't eat any more.

117
00:08:20,200 --> 00:08:21,320
There's something wrong with this fruit.

118
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:34,600
Do you still know

119
00:08:35,200 --> 00:08:36,160
who you are?

120
00:08:41,560 --> 00:08:43,240
Then look at me. Who am I?

121
00:08:49,560 --> 00:08:50,400
Meng Tinghui.

122
00:08:52,800 --> 00:08:54,160
A minister who seduces her sovereign

123
00:08:55,240 --> 00:08:56,960
should be sentenced
to death by a thousand cuts.

124
00:08:57,520 --> 00:08:58,600
If you come any closer,

125
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:02,160
we'll both be beyond redemption.

126
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:04,400
A sovereign who indulges his minister

127
00:09:05,800 --> 00:09:07,600
should write an edict
of self-reproach.

128
00:09:10,200 --> 00:09:11,960
Is Your Majesty afraid?

129
00:09:14,360 --> 00:09:16,200
I have never been afraid.

130
00:09:17,240 --> 00:09:18,960
Neither have I.

131
00:09:37,320 --> 00:09:38,360
My lord.

132
00:10:03,160 --> 00:10:05,320
Miss Shen, you're back.

133
00:10:05,400 --> 00:10:06,240
Come sit down.

134
00:10:09,360 --> 00:10:10,200
Sister.

135
00:10:13,680 --> 00:10:14,520
Give it to me.

136
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:15,640
-Careful, it's hot.
-Thank you.

137
00:10:16,240 --> 00:10:17,080
Sister.

138
00:10:17,160 --> 00:10:18,000
Thank you.

139
00:10:18,080 --> 00:10:19,520
Young Master Shen, you're back too.

140
00:10:19,600 --> 00:10:20,440
Come sit down.

141
00:10:20,520 --> 00:10:21,840
I give up on you.

142
00:10:21,920 --> 00:10:23,960
I've never met anyone
this hopeless with directions.

143
00:10:25,040 --> 00:10:26,520
We didn't find a single herb all day.

144
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:28,280
My legs are about to fall off.

145
00:10:30,120 --> 00:10:32,920
You kept complaining you were tired,
so we stopped again and again.

146
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:33,840
Otherwise, we'd have been back long ago.

147
00:10:35,560 --> 00:10:36,520
Young Master is back.

148
00:10:38,280 --> 00:10:39,120
Mengmeng.

149
00:10:40,520 --> 00:10:41,440
You're back.

150
00:10:44,280 --> 00:10:45,560
What's wrong?

151
00:10:45,800 --> 00:10:46,680
Why is your face so red?

152
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:57,560
I picked lots of fresh wild fruit.

153
00:10:57,640 --> 00:10:58,640
They'll quench everyone's thirst.

154
00:11:02,680 --> 00:11:04,360
-You should've come sooner.
-These...

155
00:11:04,440 --> 00:11:05,680
Fuzhi.

156
00:11:06,800 --> 00:11:07,800
-Don't eat them!
-Don't eat them!

157
00:11:10,880 --> 00:11:11,920
Why can't I eat them?

158
00:11:13,640 --> 00:11:14,480
These...

159
00:11:14,960 --> 00:11:16,160
These are Love Fruits.

160
00:11:16,240 --> 00:11:19,880
Couples eat them when trying to conceive.

161
00:11:24,960 --> 00:11:26,920
These wild fruits all look alike.

162
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:27,880
Young Master,

163
00:11:27,960 --> 00:11:29,560
how did you two recognize them?

164
00:11:34,520 --> 00:11:35,640
I have good news for everyone.

165
00:11:36,800 --> 00:11:37,640
The Fuqing Grass...

166
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:39,160
We found it.

167
00:11:42,760 --> 00:11:44,080
Why didn't you say so earlier?

168
00:11:44,160 --> 00:11:45,720
Well...

169
00:11:46,800 --> 00:11:47,840
Enough. Don't say it.

170
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:52,320
A-Luo.

171
00:11:53,560 --> 00:11:55,560
Do you recognize this Fuqing Grass?

172
00:11:58,040 --> 00:11:59,040
Fuqing Grass?

173
00:11:59,120 --> 00:12:01,320
We call it Moneywort in the valley.

174
00:12:01,400 --> 00:12:02,280
Every household

175
00:12:02,360 --> 00:12:04,080
grows it deep in the valley.

176
00:12:09,920 --> 00:12:11,120
Miss A-Luo.

177
00:12:11,800 --> 00:12:12,760
There's something

178
00:12:13,360 --> 00:12:14,320
we need to tell you.

179
00:12:17,360 --> 00:12:19,080
The herb merchant surnamed Lü told us

180
00:12:19,160 --> 00:12:20,000
Moneywort

181
00:12:20,080 --> 00:12:22,080
was a rare and precious medicinal herb.

182
00:12:22,160 --> 00:12:24,080
That's why we began growing it in bulk.

183
00:12:24,160 --> 00:12:25,360
We villagers

184
00:12:25,440 --> 00:12:27,120
only wanted to live off the land

185
00:12:27,200 --> 00:12:29,480
and trade herbs for money
to cover our needs.

186
00:12:29,560 --> 00:12:30,680
We never imagined

187
00:12:31,320 --> 00:12:33,200
they would use the Moneywort

188
00:12:33,280 --> 00:12:35,120
to do so many terrible things.

189
00:12:35,600 --> 00:12:37,480
Miss A-Luo, don't be alarmed.

190
00:12:37,560 --> 00:12:38,960
We're telling you the truth

191
00:12:39,040 --> 00:12:41,200
because we believe the villagers
were exploited by criminals.

192
00:12:42,160 --> 00:12:43,640
Seven days ago,

193
00:12:43,720 --> 00:12:45,760
my brother was the one
who delivered the herbs.

194
00:12:46,320 --> 00:12:48,000
I thought he had gone hunting.

195
00:12:48,920 --> 00:12:49,760
Do you think

196
00:12:51,480 --> 00:12:52,480
he might have...?

197
00:12:52,560 --> 00:12:54,360
Miss A-Luo, don't worry.

198
00:12:54,440 --> 00:12:55,440
We came here

199
00:12:55,520 --> 00:12:57,160
to uncover the true mastermind

200
00:12:57,760 --> 00:12:59,320
and wipe out the entire criminal ring.

201
00:12:59,400 --> 00:13:00,320
Tomorrow,

202
00:13:00,400 --> 00:13:01,640
we must follow this herb shipment

203
00:13:01,720 --> 00:13:03,480
straight into their lair.

204
00:13:05,120 --> 00:13:07,240
I'll help you fight those villains.

205
00:13:07,800 --> 00:13:10,440
Normally, we deliver herbs
at the start of each month.

206
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:12,760
But we just received word

207
00:13:12,840 --> 00:13:14,840
that the merchant urgently wants
our entire stock.

208
00:13:15,560 --> 00:13:17,680
It must be delivered tomorrow morning.

209
00:13:21,600 --> 00:13:23,800
A-Luo, come prepare the flowers.

210
00:13:27,560 --> 00:13:28,520
Miss A-Luo.

211
00:13:28,600 --> 00:13:29,960
This matter is extremely serious.

212
00:13:30,720 --> 00:13:31,920
Don't let word of it leak.

213
00:13:33,200 --> 00:13:34,360
Don't worry, Miss Meng.

214
00:13:34,440 --> 00:13:35,880
I know what's at stake.

215
00:13:36,760 --> 00:13:38,000
You can make your plans.

216
00:13:38,720 --> 00:13:39,880
I'll...

217
00:13:39,960 --> 00:13:41,560
go deal with things outside.

218
00:13:51,240 --> 00:13:53,240
Ling Yunfei and the remnants
of the Tiger's Roar Gang

219
00:13:53,320 --> 00:13:55,280
are very likely hiding
at the poison-making lair.

220
00:13:57,360 --> 00:13:59,600
Your Majesty, I received a secret report.

221
00:13:59,680 --> 00:14:01,040
Wangxian Valley's terrain is complex.

222
00:14:01,120 --> 00:14:02,880
The main Divine Guard force
was delayed on the road.

223
00:14:02,960 --> 00:14:04,080
They won't arrive until noon tomorrow.

224
00:14:04,680 --> 00:14:06,560
But the merchant is trading
first thing tomorrow morning.

225
00:14:06,640 --> 00:14:07,720
If we wait for the main force,

226
00:14:07,800 --> 00:14:09,360
we'll certainly miss our chance.

227
00:14:09,440 --> 00:14:10,680
A-Luo's brother

228
00:14:10,760 --> 00:14:12,320
and the villagers who recently vanished

229
00:14:12,400 --> 00:14:13,960
may have been taken hostage.

230
00:14:14,520 --> 00:14:15,400
Every extra day they're held

231
00:14:15,480 --> 00:14:16,480
puts them in greater danger.

232
00:14:16,560 --> 00:14:18,040
The situation has changed.

233
00:14:18,120 --> 00:14:19,120
Your Majesty, please decide.

234
00:14:19,920 --> 00:14:21,000
Di Nian.

235
00:14:21,080 --> 00:14:22,040
Leave the valley tonight.

236
00:14:22,120 --> 00:14:23,160
At any cost,

237
00:14:23,240 --> 00:14:24,840
bring the Divine Guard here
as quickly as possible.

238
00:14:25,400 --> 00:14:27,800
Zhishu, take Zhili and Fuzhi

239
00:14:27,880 --> 00:14:29,800
and remain here to protect the villagers

240
00:14:29,880 --> 00:14:30,840
and provide support.

241
00:14:31,480 --> 00:14:32,800
-I obey.
-I obey.

242
00:14:33,560 --> 00:14:34,560
What about Mengmeng?

243
00:14:34,640 --> 00:14:36,880
The plan stands,
but we must change our approach.

244
00:14:36,960 --> 00:14:38,880
Tomorrow we'll disguise ourselves
as villagers delivering herbs

245
00:14:38,960 --> 00:14:40,040
and infiltrate first,

246
00:14:40,120 --> 00:14:41,600
buying time for Di Nian
and the Divine Guard.

247
00:14:42,920 --> 00:14:43,840
If Lord Meng is going,

248
00:14:43,920 --> 00:14:45,040
I'm going too.

249
00:14:46,520 --> 00:14:48,200
Tomorrow, we will capture Ling Yunfei

250
00:14:48,920 --> 00:14:50,720
and destroy the Infinity Pills.

251
00:15:03,160 --> 00:15:05,360
That damned emperor and Meng Tinghui

252
00:15:05,440 --> 00:15:06,560
have already found Wangxian Valley.

253
00:15:06,640 --> 00:15:09,080
Tomorrow they'll infiltrate
Poisoned Men Tomb.

254
00:15:09,160 --> 00:15:11,080
Sir has deliberately let them investigate.

255
00:15:11,160 --> 00:15:12,680
We've already produced
a large batch of Infinity Pills.

256
00:15:12,760 --> 00:15:15,760
-If they destroy the Tomb too...
-That would actually...

257
00:15:15,840 --> 00:15:17,280
be exactly what Sir wants.

258
00:15:17,360 --> 00:15:20,440
Sir originally planned to profit
secretly from the Infinity Pills.

259
00:15:20,520 --> 00:15:22,280
But that mad dog Ling Yunfei

260
00:15:22,360 --> 00:15:24,760
will do anything to kill Meng Tinghui.

261
00:15:24,840 --> 00:15:26,520
He even dared attack Sir.

262
00:15:26,600 --> 00:15:28,080
He's long been beyond control.

263
00:15:28,160 --> 00:15:31,080
Sir has ordered the physicians
to withdraw in batches.

264
00:15:31,160 --> 00:15:32,720
Ling Yunfei and Poisoned Men Tomb

265
00:15:32,800 --> 00:15:34,320
are now expendable pieces.

266
00:15:34,400 --> 00:15:37,320
Consider them a gift for Meng Tinghui.

267
00:15:37,400 --> 00:15:38,680
Tomorrow's trap

268
00:15:39,160 --> 00:15:40,680
is designed to lure them straight in.

269
00:15:41,240 --> 00:15:43,360
Mr. Shangguan means to kill
with a borrowed blade,

270
00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:45,400
letting Ying Gua and Ling Yunfei
destroy each other.

271
00:15:45,480 --> 00:15:47,200
Whether Ling Yunfei lives or dies

272
00:15:47,280 --> 00:15:48,200
doesn't matter.

273
00:15:48,280 --> 00:15:49,360
But Ying Gua

274
00:15:50,160 --> 00:15:52,440
must die in Poisoned Men Tomb.

275
00:15:52,520 --> 00:15:55,400
Then everyone will believe
Ling Yunfei killed the emperor.

276
00:15:55,480 --> 00:15:56,840
With the realm leaderless,

277
00:15:56,920 --> 00:15:58,040
this magnificent land

278
00:15:58,120 --> 00:15:59,760
will ultimately belong to Zhongwan.

279
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:08,000
-Kill Ying Gua!
-Kill Ying Gua!

280
00:16:19,480 --> 00:16:20,400
Keep feeding them.

281
00:16:21,360 --> 00:16:22,240
Not a single pill is to be left.

282
00:16:22,320 --> 00:16:23,720
-Yes.
-Yes.

283
00:16:24,920 --> 00:16:25,760
Chief.

284
00:16:26,520 --> 00:16:28,120
-A letter from the Right Chancellor.
-Read it.

285
00:16:28,200 --> 00:16:30,320
Meng Tinghui and the others
have been away from the capital for days.

286
00:16:30,400 --> 00:16:32,720
Stop the Infinity Pill operation at once.

287
00:16:32,800 --> 00:16:34,480
-Don't...
-Keep reading.

288
00:16:35,400 --> 00:16:36,840
Stop acting like a madman
and dragging me down with you.

289
00:16:38,200 --> 00:16:39,680
He thinks he can order me around?

290
00:16:39,760 --> 00:16:40,880
I'll do the opposite.

291
00:16:41,440 --> 00:16:42,560
Tell those physicians

292
00:16:43,120 --> 00:16:44,160
to work day and night

293
00:16:44,240 --> 00:16:45,520
and speed up production
of the Infinity Pills.

294
00:16:45,600 --> 00:16:46,480
This time,

295
00:16:46,560 --> 00:16:49,240
I'll make Meng Tinghui taste
an Infinity Pill herself

296
00:16:49,320 --> 00:16:51,520
and turn the entire capital into chaos.

297
00:16:52,400 --> 00:16:53,240
Chief.

298
00:16:53,720 --> 00:16:55,000
The Tiger's Roar Gang was raided.

299
00:16:55,080 --> 00:16:56,440
We retreated to Poisoned Men Tomb,

300
00:16:56,520 --> 00:16:58,280
and less than half our men remain.

301
00:16:58,360 --> 00:17:00,600
We shouldn't confront them head-on now.

302
00:17:00,680 --> 00:17:01,720
As long as we're alive, we can...

303
00:17:01,800 --> 00:17:02,800
What about Ruyan's revenge?

304
00:17:03,840 --> 00:17:05,320
What about your brother Lü Er's life?

305
00:17:06,000 --> 00:17:07,200
If you're afraid to die,

306
00:17:07,280 --> 00:17:08,120
get out now.

307
00:17:09,200 --> 00:17:10,240
Why would you say that, Chief?

308
00:17:10,320 --> 00:17:12,360
We've shared life and death
for more than ten years.

309
00:17:12,440 --> 00:17:14,200
When have I ever said I was afraid?

310
00:17:15,920 --> 00:17:17,120
In this lifetime,

311
00:17:17,640 --> 00:17:19,360
I, Lü Da, will never abandon you.

312
00:17:20,080 --> 00:17:21,080
All these years,

313
00:17:22,320 --> 00:17:23,720
you've risked your life for me

314
00:17:24,880 --> 00:17:27,600
and treated me better
than my own brother ever did.

315
00:17:27,680 --> 00:17:29,280
Yet the people dearest to us

316
00:17:29,360 --> 00:17:30,880
were all killed because of Meng Tinghui.

317
00:17:30,960 --> 00:17:32,560
If we don't avenge them,

318
00:17:32,640 --> 00:17:33,760
what meaning is there

319
00:17:33,840 --> 00:17:34,960
in staying alive?

320
00:17:35,520 --> 00:17:36,360
Chief.

321
00:17:37,520 --> 00:17:39,360
I know that since Sister Ruyan died,

322
00:17:40,240 --> 00:17:41,640
your heart has been in agony.

323
00:17:42,640 --> 00:17:44,800
And I want revenge for my brother
just as badly.

324
00:17:45,920 --> 00:17:47,600
Since you've made your decision,

325
00:17:48,800 --> 00:17:50,160
I'll follow you to the death.

326
00:17:57,760 --> 00:17:58,920
Good brother.

327
00:17:59,480 --> 00:18:00,440
But Chief,

328
00:18:01,040 --> 00:18:02,880
the Right Chancellor's letter says

329
00:18:02,960 --> 00:18:04,800
Meng Tinghui and the others
aren't in the capital.

330
00:18:05,480 --> 00:18:06,480
Could they

331
00:18:06,560 --> 00:18:08,000
have already traced us
to Wangxian Valley?

332
00:18:10,320 --> 00:18:11,440
This batch of Infinity Pills

333
00:18:11,520 --> 00:18:13,000
is almost complete.

334
00:18:13,080 --> 00:18:15,640
Those villagers are nothing
but a burden now.

335
00:18:16,200 --> 00:18:18,280
Once the final herbs arrive,

336
00:18:19,720 --> 00:18:21,360
take men and massacre the valley.

337
00:18:21,880 --> 00:18:23,360
Leave no loose ends.

338
00:18:26,080 --> 00:18:29,520
Every year at the Flower Festival,
we exchange flowers to show our feelings.

339
00:18:29,600 --> 00:18:30,880
These flowers are for you.

340
00:18:30,960 --> 00:18:32,640
May you all be safe and blessed.

341
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:35,000
Thank you, Miss A-Luo.

342
00:18:35,080 --> 00:18:38,280
Then we wish Miss A-Luo
and all the villagers

343
00:18:38,360 --> 00:18:40,120
peace and good health, year after year.

344
00:18:40,200 --> 00:18:41,040
Thank you.

345
00:18:43,200 --> 00:18:44,040
Old Huang.

346
00:18:44,120 --> 00:18:45,160
What are you grinning about?

347
00:18:45,920 --> 00:18:46,760
Old Huang,

348
00:18:47,480 --> 00:18:49,640
Miss A-Luo cared for your injured leg.

349
00:18:49,720 --> 00:18:51,600
Shouldn't you give her flowers
to thank her?

350
00:18:51,680 --> 00:18:52,920
That's right, Huang Bo.

351
00:18:53,000 --> 00:18:54,440
We're leaving tomorrow.

352
00:18:55,160 --> 00:18:56,320
Go on.

353
00:18:58,400 --> 00:18:59,360
Miss A-Luo.

354
00:19:01,280 --> 00:19:02,200
No words can repay your kindness.

355
00:19:03,520 --> 00:19:04,520
Old Huang.

356
00:19:04,600 --> 00:19:07,000
Are you swearing brotherhood
with Miss A-Luo?

357
00:19:08,440 --> 00:19:09,280
A-Nian.

358
00:19:09,360 --> 00:19:11,240
Here. No words can repay your kindness.

359
00:19:11,800 --> 00:19:12,880
Thank you.

360
00:19:15,080 --> 00:19:16,120
Sister!

361
00:19:16,200 --> 00:19:18,840
-Will you swing with us, Sister?
-Hold this.

362
00:19:18,920 --> 00:19:20,080
Let's go.

363
00:19:20,160 --> 00:19:21,000
Xiaoyue.

364
00:19:21,080 --> 00:19:22,600
Let this peachwood bear witness.

365
00:19:22,680 --> 00:19:23,760
I, A-Niu, will spend my life

366
00:19:23,840 --> 00:19:25,680
admiring every season's flowers with you,

367
00:19:25,760 --> 00:19:27,440
and sharing every dawn and dusk.

368
00:19:28,320 --> 00:19:29,280
May it bind you and me,

369
00:19:29,360 --> 00:19:30,880
our hearts united forever.

370
00:19:31,520 --> 00:19:32,400
I will.

371
00:19:34,400 --> 00:19:36,120
Why did he give her that peachwood?

372
00:19:36,840 --> 00:19:38,320
It's a custom of Wangxian Valley.

373
00:19:38,400 --> 00:19:40,200
Peachwood is exchanged
to express romantic feelings.

374
00:19:42,320 --> 00:19:43,280
Zhili.

375
00:19:43,800 --> 00:19:45,560
The villagers say the Flower Festival
is for giving flowers and blessings.

376
00:19:45,640 --> 00:19:47,200
I'm leaving the valley soon.

377
00:19:47,840 --> 00:19:49,960
This flower is for you.

378
00:19:56,800 --> 00:19:58,000
A-Nian.

379
00:19:58,080 --> 00:19:59,320
With this flower,

380
00:19:59,400 --> 00:20:00,240
I wish you

381
00:20:00,320 --> 00:20:01,440
find a girl you truly love,

382
00:20:01,520 --> 00:20:02,920
so that one day

383
00:20:03,000 --> 00:20:04,240
I won't need to worry about you anymore.

384
00:20:28,920 --> 00:20:30,480
This is one of our local specialties.

385
00:20:30,560 --> 00:20:31,720
You can't even get it in the capital.

386
00:20:56,520 --> 00:20:57,520
A-Luo.

387
00:20:57,600 --> 00:20:58,560
What's wrong?

388
00:21:00,280 --> 00:21:01,680
Every year at the Flower Festival,

389
00:21:02,440 --> 00:21:04,840
my brother makes my favorite flower cakes.

390
00:21:06,480 --> 00:21:07,840
I wish he were here.

391
00:21:10,160 --> 00:21:11,760
You weave those flowers beautifully.

392
00:21:16,560 --> 00:21:17,400
Would you like to learn?

393
00:21:22,560 --> 00:21:23,640
Miss A-Luo.

394
00:21:23,720 --> 00:21:24,640
Look at this.

395
00:21:28,080 --> 00:21:30,480
Does it look bad?

396
00:21:30,560 --> 00:21:32,120
I think it's beautiful.

397
00:21:32,200 --> 00:21:33,720
It's

398
00:21:33,800 --> 00:21:35,080
the most unique flower crown
I've ever seen.

399
00:21:47,240 --> 00:21:48,440
Does it look good?

400
00:21:50,040 --> 00:21:51,240
It does.

401
00:22:00,520 --> 00:22:01,880
The festival's nearly over,

402
00:22:01,960 --> 00:22:03,000
and you still haven't given away
your flowers.

403
00:22:06,800 --> 00:22:07,760
A worthy beauty is hard to find.

404
00:22:07,840 --> 00:22:09,480
I need to choose the right moment

405
00:22:09,560 --> 00:22:10,480
to prove my sincerity.

406
00:22:11,160 --> 00:22:12,560
So...

407
00:22:12,640 --> 00:22:14,480
you had your eye on my swing.

408
00:22:14,560 --> 00:22:15,600
I'll leave it to you two.

409
00:22:18,040 --> 00:22:19,080
I've looked around.

410
00:22:19,160 --> 00:22:20,200
Of all the girls here,

411
00:22:20,280 --> 00:22:21,120
none is prettier than you.

412
00:22:21,200 --> 00:22:22,320
Shen Zhishu.

413
00:22:22,920 --> 00:22:24,680
How many girls

414
00:22:24,760 --> 00:22:26,240
have heard those sweet lines from you?

415
00:22:30,320 --> 00:22:31,160
Yes.

416
00:22:32,160 --> 00:22:33,600
I used to live recklessly,

417
00:22:34,280 --> 00:22:35,680
thinking being a playboy meant happiness.

418
00:22:36,920 --> 00:22:38,080
It wasn't until I met you

419
00:22:44,040 --> 00:22:45,200
that I learned what fear truly is.

420
00:22:46,800 --> 00:22:47,720
Afraid of what?

421
00:22:50,360 --> 00:22:51,240
Afraid to see you frown.

422
00:22:52,200 --> 00:22:53,400
Afraid you'll turn away.

423
00:22:55,240 --> 00:22:56,080
And even more afraid...

424
00:22:59,040 --> 00:23:00,280
you won't believe

425
00:23:01,840 --> 00:23:03,920
that my heart has room
for no one but you.

426
00:23:10,640 --> 00:23:12,160
Maybe right now

427
00:23:13,080 --> 00:23:14,320
you do care for me.

428
00:23:15,360 --> 00:23:17,720
But how long will those feelings last?

429
00:23:18,600 --> 00:23:20,400
There are so many noble ladies
in the capital

430
00:23:20,880 --> 00:23:22,200
all waiting for Young Lord Shen.

431
00:23:23,320 --> 00:23:24,800
Can you truly give up

432
00:23:24,880 --> 00:23:25,960
all those beauties?

433
00:23:26,760 --> 00:23:27,840
I promise you,

434
00:23:27,920 --> 00:23:28,920
if I ever flirt with another woman,

435
00:23:29,000 --> 00:23:29,920
you can leave me without hesitation.

436
00:23:32,280 --> 00:23:33,360
Will you give me

437
00:23:34,880 --> 00:23:36,120
a chance to prove myself?

438
00:23:57,440 --> 00:23:58,600
How much of your salary did this cost?

439
00:23:59,960 --> 00:24:00,800
Why waste the money?

440
00:24:01,600 --> 00:24:04,360
I'd be most afraid if you didn't know
how many years of salary this cost me.

441
00:24:04,440 --> 00:24:05,960
How else could I prove my sincerity?

442
00:24:15,360 --> 00:24:16,480
I know.

443
00:24:18,480 --> 00:24:19,960
You're afraid you'll hinder my career.

444
00:24:22,280 --> 00:24:23,880
But how could I not know
how you feel?

445
00:24:26,520 --> 00:24:27,440
And how could you

446
00:24:28,600 --> 00:24:29,920
not know how I feel?

447
00:24:49,960 --> 00:24:51,040
It suits you quite well.

448
00:24:54,080 --> 00:24:55,600
I picked it out when we first met.

449
00:24:57,840 --> 00:24:58,720
Fool.

450
00:25:04,400 --> 00:25:05,760
Does it still hurt?

451
00:25:08,960 --> 00:25:09,920
It does.

452
00:25:16,160 --> 00:25:17,600
Then you'll remember it for life.

453
00:26:24,160 --> 00:26:25,840
The Flower Festival is so lively outside.

454
00:26:25,920 --> 00:26:27,680
Why aren't you celebrating with them?

455
00:26:27,760 --> 00:26:29,520
When I look at these villagers,

456
00:26:30,040 --> 00:26:31,520
my feelings are complicated.

457
00:26:31,600 --> 00:26:33,080
They're so simple and honest.

458
00:26:34,480 --> 00:26:35,800
They only wanted to use Fuqing Grass

459
00:26:35,880 --> 00:26:37,320
to earn a little money,

460
00:26:37,400 --> 00:26:39,000
yet the Tiger's Roar Gang exploited them

461
00:26:40,080 --> 00:26:42,360
to help produce the Infinity Pills.

462
00:26:42,920 --> 00:26:44,760
As the saying goes,
it isn't the blade that kills,

463
00:26:45,440 --> 00:26:46,720
but the person wielding it.

464
00:26:48,240 --> 00:26:49,720
Fuqing Grass itself isn't frightening.

465
00:26:50,200 --> 00:26:52,200
What's frightening is those
who use it with evil intent.

466
00:27:50,280 --> 00:27:51,400
Follow this mountain path

467
00:27:51,480 --> 00:27:52,560
about five kilometers ahead.

468
00:27:52,640 --> 00:27:55,520
That's where we trade herbs
with the merchant.

469
00:27:55,600 --> 00:27:57,000
The mountain road is rough,

470
00:27:57,080 --> 00:27:58,240
so you'll need to travel through the night.

471
00:27:58,800 --> 00:27:59,960
As for my brother...

472
00:28:00,760 --> 00:28:01,760
I'm entrusting him to you.

473
00:28:01,840 --> 00:28:03,320
Don't worry, Miss A-Luo.

474
00:28:04,080 --> 00:28:05,600
We'll do everything we can

475
00:28:05,680 --> 00:28:06,960
to find out where your brother is.

476
00:28:07,040 --> 00:28:08,200
Don't worry.

477
00:28:10,840 --> 00:28:11,920
Your leg still hasn't healed.

478
00:28:12,760 --> 00:28:13,760
Please be careful.

479
00:28:16,400 --> 00:28:17,720
I embroidered this sachet.

480
00:28:17,800 --> 00:28:18,960
My brother has one too.

481
00:28:19,040 --> 00:28:20,120
I hope

482
00:28:20,800 --> 00:28:22,440
both of you return safe and sound.

483
00:28:27,760 --> 00:28:28,840
Miss A-Luo.

484
00:28:29,760 --> 00:28:32,160
I don't have anything with me
to give you.

485
00:28:33,160 --> 00:28:34,160
When I come back next time,

486
00:28:34,760 --> 00:28:36,360
I'll weave you a beautiful flower crown.

487
00:28:38,200 --> 00:28:39,440
I'll wait for you.

488
00:28:41,240 --> 00:28:42,520
It's getting late.

489
00:28:42,600 --> 00:28:43,440
We should set out.

490
00:29:09,440 --> 00:29:10,320
Gentlemen.

491
00:29:10,400 --> 00:29:12,280
All four crates of Fuqing Grass are here.

492
00:29:12,360 --> 00:29:13,280
Please inspect them.

493
00:29:13,360 --> 00:29:14,360
We've been watching you two for a while.

494
00:29:14,440 --> 00:29:15,360
We've never seen you before.

495
00:29:16,000 --> 00:29:17,320
The two of us

496
00:29:17,400 --> 00:29:18,600
are from this val...

497
00:29:19,120 --> 00:29:20,560
Looking to die?

498
00:29:20,640 --> 00:29:21,840
Sir, please calm down.

499
00:29:21,920 --> 00:29:24,640
It's my brother's first herb delivery.
He doesn't know the rules.

500
00:29:30,680 --> 00:29:32,640
All the herbs are here.

501
00:29:33,120 --> 00:29:34,360
Then this...

502
00:29:36,520 --> 00:29:37,480
Get lost.

503
00:29:37,560 --> 00:29:38,440
Right away.

504
00:29:39,520 --> 00:29:40,440
May you prosper, sir.

505
00:29:49,520 --> 00:29:50,360
Quickly.

506
00:29:50,440 --> 00:29:51,800
Move all the ingredients
to the storehouse.

507
00:30:43,480 --> 00:30:44,440
There's nothing here.

508
00:30:45,360 --> 00:30:46,800
Have they already sent them
to the capital?

509
00:30:48,000 --> 00:30:49,600
Looks like they know we're onto them.

510
00:30:54,720 --> 00:30:55,640
Lord Meng.

511
00:30:57,000 --> 00:30:58,480
You're looking for the Infinity Pills,
aren't you?

512
00:31:00,320 --> 00:31:01,440
I brought them for you.

513
00:31:04,520 --> 00:31:06,360
Today we'll wipe out this poison den

514
00:31:07,000 --> 00:31:08,240
and take you back to the capital for trial.

515
00:31:08,320 --> 00:31:10,440
You walk into my territory

516
00:31:10,520 --> 00:31:12,480
and still dare talk so big?

517
00:31:12,560 --> 00:31:14,840
I've ordered the Divine Guard
to surround this place.

518
00:31:15,640 --> 00:31:16,760
You think you can use Infinity Pills
to throw the capital into chaos?

519
00:31:17,320 --> 00:31:18,360
Keep dreaming.

520
00:31:18,440 --> 00:31:21,040
Even the emperor of Daning came.

521
00:31:21,120 --> 00:31:22,200
But your law

522
00:31:22,280 --> 00:31:23,920
doesn't reach Poisoned Men Tomb.

523
00:31:40,000 --> 00:31:41,520
Do you see?

524
00:31:41,600 --> 00:31:43,840
They've been tempered
with massive doses of Infinity Pills.

525
00:31:43,920 --> 00:31:45,640
They've gone from drugged subjects
to poison-fueled killers.

526
00:31:46,480 --> 00:31:48,200
If they appeared on the capital's streets,

527
00:31:49,120 --> 00:31:51,080
what a magnificent sight that would be.

528
00:31:51,160 --> 00:31:52,360
Before long, the entire capital

529
00:31:52,440 --> 00:31:54,280
will become my living hell.

530
00:31:54,360 --> 00:31:56,440
Every citizen will die with you.

531
00:33:40,720 --> 00:33:41,760
I embroidered this sachet.

532
00:33:41,840 --> 00:33:43,160
My brother has one too.

533
00:33:43,240 --> 00:33:44,360
A-Luo's brother.

534
00:34:01,000 --> 00:34:02,240
So much time has passed.

535
00:34:04,040 --> 00:34:06,040
I wonder if things are going smoothly
for Mengmeng.

536
00:34:08,760 --> 00:34:10,480
I heard honey water relieves fatigue
and helps you sleep.

537
00:34:10,560 --> 00:34:11,840
I mixed it specially with warm water.

538
00:34:11,920 --> 00:34:13,840
Not too hot, not too cold. Try it.

539
00:34:16,280 --> 00:34:17,440
Shen Zhishu, you're cheating!

540
00:34:40,080 --> 00:34:41,120
This is what cheating looks like.

541
00:34:42,520 --> 00:34:43,600
Brother.

542
00:34:45,320 --> 00:34:46,440
You two...

543
00:34:47,240 --> 00:34:48,920
It's exactly what you saw.

544
00:34:49,000 --> 00:34:50,040
We're together now.

545
00:34:56,440 --> 00:34:57,920
I knew long ago

546
00:34:58,000 --> 00:34:59,120
that you two would end up together.

547
00:34:59,840 --> 00:35:01,040
But seeing you now,

548
00:35:01,120 --> 00:35:02,400
so inseparable

549
00:35:02,480 --> 00:35:03,640
and so lovey-dovey,

550
00:35:03,720 --> 00:35:05,280
really is more than I expected.

551
00:35:05,840 --> 00:35:07,560
If you're jealous, go find someone yourself.

552
00:35:10,080 --> 00:35:11,960
-Sweet?
-Sweet.

553
00:35:12,560 --> 00:35:14,640
Young Master Shen. Miss Shen.

554
00:35:15,200 --> 00:35:16,200
Miss A-Luo.

555
00:35:16,280 --> 00:35:17,120
Something's wrong.

556
00:35:17,200 --> 00:35:19,480
I just saw several strangers
outside the valley.

557
00:35:19,560 --> 00:35:21,680
They looked like the people
who tricked us into selling Fuqing Grass.

558
00:35:23,160 --> 00:35:24,000
Miss A-Luo.

559
00:35:24,080 --> 00:35:24,920
You villagers don't know martial arts.

560
00:35:25,000 --> 00:35:26,960
Is there somewhere safe to hide?

561
00:35:27,040 --> 00:35:30,160
Yes. Deep in the valley,
there's an abandoned watchtower.

562
00:35:30,240 --> 00:35:32,120
The villagers usually rest there.

563
00:35:32,880 --> 00:35:33,920
The tower is easy to defend.

564
00:35:34,000 --> 00:35:34,920
Take everyone there and hide at once.

565
00:35:35,000 --> 00:35:36,200
I'll notify the villagers immediately.

566
00:35:36,280 --> 00:35:37,360
I'll go with you.

567
00:35:38,040 --> 00:35:38,880
Don't worry.

568
00:35:38,960 --> 00:35:40,240
I'll meet up with you soon.

569
00:35:40,320 --> 00:35:42,320
Brother, be careful.

570
00:35:42,400 --> 00:35:43,600
Remember to drink it.

571
00:36:01,400 --> 00:36:02,240
Hurry!

572
00:36:03,840 --> 00:36:04,960
Move!

573
00:36:05,040 --> 00:36:07,000
-Hurry!
-Move! Kneel down!

574
00:36:07,720 --> 00:36:09,560
Don't hit my sister!

575
00:36:09,640 --> 00:36:10,760
The Chief gave orders.

576
00:36:11,400 --> 00:36:12,440
No harming children.

577
00:36:13,720 --> 00:36:16,360
Please, good sirs, spare our lives.

578
00:36:16,920 --> 00:36:18,560
We're only farmers.

579
00:36:23,920 --> 00:36:26,240
-Farmers?
-Farmers.

580
00:36:26,320 --> 00:36:27,760
Perfect.

581
00:36:27,960 --> 00:36:29,760
Your corpse can fertilize the fields.

582
00:36:34,360 --> 00:36:35,720
A-Niu!

583
00:36:39,560 --> 00:36:40,760
A-Niu!

584
00:36:45,080 --> 00:36:45,920
Stop!

585
00:36:50,280 --> 00:36:51,280
Young Lord Shen.

586
00:36:52,720 --> 00:36:53,920
You're quite clever.

587
00:36:54,440 --> 00:36:55,960
You even managed to find this place.

588
00:36:57,000 --> 00:36:58,800
You spare neither the old nor weak,
women nor children.

589
00:36:59,400 --> 00:37:01,360
The Tiger's Roar Gang is lower
than beasts.

590
00:37:01,920 --> 00:37:03,960
Every one of these lives is worthless.

591
00:37:04,040 --> 00:37:05,360
What does it matter if they die?

592
00:37:05,960 --> 00:37:07,840
Everyone here dies today,

593
00:37:08,400 --> 00:37:09,240
including you.

594
00:37:10,400 --> 00:37:11,240
Kill him!

595
00:37:56,840 --> 00:37:57,760
After him!

596
00:37:57,840 --> 00:37:58,680
Go!

597
00:38:03,880 --> 00:38:04,800
Everyone, get up.

598
00:38:05,640 --> 00:38:06,640
You're safe now.

599
00:38:11,360 --> 00:38:14,560
-Thank you, Lord Shen.
-Thank you, Lord Shen.

600
00:38:14,640 --> 00:38:16,080
Thank you, Lord Shen.

601
00:38:16,160 --> 00:38:17,000
Go home now.

602
00:38:17,760 --> 00:38:18,720
Go on.

603
00:38:53,400 --> 00:38:54,240
Your Majesty.

604
00:38:56,360 --> 00:38:58,320
The guards in the side passage
delayed us for a while.

605
00:38:58,400 --> 00:39:00,200
-We arrived too late.
-It's fine.

606
00:39:00,280 --> 00:39:01,680
They've already moved
the Infinity Pills out.

607
00:39:01,760 --> 00:39:04,200
Yinqing, search this place
for any Infinity Pills left behind.

608
00:39:04,280 --> 00:39:05,880
Destroy every last one.

609
00:39:05,960 --> 00:39:06,800
Huang Bo.

610
00:39:06,880 --> 00:39:08,120
Come with me to hold Ling Yunfei off.

611
00:39:08,200 --> 00:39:09,520
Yes.

612
00:39:25,320 --> 00:39:27,160
Even that couldn't kill you.

613
00:39:27,240 --> 00:39:28,600
Ling Yunfei.

614
00:39:29,000 --> 00:39:30,440
You have slaughtered my people

615
00:39:30,520 --> 00:39:31,600
and brought ruin upon Daning.

616
00:39:31,680 --> 00:39:33,760
Your crimes cannot be atoned for
even with ten thousand deaths.

617
00:39:34,680 --> 00:39:36,520
Today is your day to die.

618
00:39:36,600 --> 00:39:37,680
Kill them!

619
00:40:20,440 --> 00:40:21,600
Your Majesty, watch out!
